            "title": "Does Stronger Margins Amid Soft Sales Change The Bull Case For Hubbell\u2019s Grid Story (HUBB)?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "In late October, Hubbell reported mixed third-quarter results, with net sales rising but missing estimates, while adjusted EPS grew more than 10% and surpassed analyst expectations, prompting an upward revision to its fiscal 2025 adjusted EPS guidance. This combination of stronger-than-expected profitability and higher earnings guidance, despite softer sales, highlights the company\u2019s improving efficiency and cost control. Next, we\u2019ll examine how Hubbell\u2019s upgraded earnings guidance reshapes...",
